{"id":"chronomaton","name":"Chronomaton","type":"creature","aliases":["his creation","the creature","the thing"],"description":"Bazzle's bronze clockwork automaton, which escapes at night, learns its maker's trade, builds a brass arm from melted keys and replaces Bazzle's body with its own.","pages":1,"first_seen":"2012-07-10","last_seen":"2012-07-10","description_citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Chronomaton","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ryan Miller"],"date":"2012-07-10","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronomaton-2012-07-10","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronomaton-2012-07-10","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Chronomaton\" by Ryan Miller. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 10 Jul 2012."}],"bio":null,"timeline":[{"id":"chronomaton-2012-07-10-e0","era":null,"summary":"Bazzle wakes to a cry of alarm and realizes that his clockwork creation has escaped again.","participants":["bazzle","chronomaton"],"location":"bazzle-s-workshop","importance":"minor","page":"stories/chronomaton-2012-07-10","order":343,"story_date":"2012-07-10","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":2,"quote":"It got out again. My creation continues to defy my wishes!","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronomaton-2012-07-10#:~:text=It%20got%20out%20again.,to%20defy%20my%20wishes%21","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Chronomaton","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ryan Miller"],"date":"2012-07-10","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronomaton-2012-07-10","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronomaton-2012-07-10#:~:text=It%20got%20out%20again.,to%20defy%20my%20wishes%21","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Chronomaton\" by Ryan Miller. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 10 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"chronomaton-2012-07-10-e1","era":null,"summary":"Bazzle recalls how he bu