ted%20keys.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Chronomaton\" by Ryan Miller. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 10 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"chronomaton-2012-07-10-e3","era":null,"summary":"Bazzle realizes the creature has learned its creator's trade and effectively become his apprentice.","participants":["bazzle","chronomaton"],"location":"bazzle-s-workshop","importance":"major","page":"stories/chronomaton-2012-07-10","order":343,"story_date":"2012-07-10","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":19,"quote":"Now, it seemed, he finally had an apprentice.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronomaton-2012-07-10#:~:text=Now%2C%20it%20seemed%2C%20he%20finally%20had%20an%20apprentice.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Chronomaton","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ryan Miller"],"date":"2012-07-10","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronomaton-2012-07-10","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronomaton-2012-07-10#:~:text=Now%2C%20it%20seemed%2C%20he%20finally%20had%20an%20apprentice.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Chronomaton\" by Ryan Miller. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 10 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"chronomaton-2012-07-10-e4","era":null,"summary":"Bazzle tries to dislodge the creature's chest key, but the creature winds itself and strikes him in the face.","participants":["bazzle","chronomaton"],"location":"bazzle-s-workshop","importance":"major","page":"stories/chronomaton-2012-07-10","order":343,"story_date":"2012-07-10","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":21,"quote":"Before Bazzle could do anything, the hand swung back and struck him squarely in the face.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronomaton-2012-07-10#:~:text=Before%20Bazzle%20could%20do,squarely%20in%20the%20face.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Chronomaton","series":"Magic Story","author